-∿

You've reached a small node on the Reticulum mesh. No IP addresses, no DNS, no
servers in the middle: just keys, announces, and whatever links happen to connect
us right now. If you're reading this over LoRa, hello from the other end of the radio.

I'm Marcus. I build automations for a living, study networking at Sheridan, run a
homelab, and am learning to build watches by hand. This node is where I write things
down.

